        <span class="eyb">Packaging industry challenges</span>
        <h2>After the machine ships, you go blind.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Packaging machinery manufacturers face unique challenges in today&rsquo;s fast-paced, multi-SKU environment. Three of them cost money on every line you have installed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid chal rv">

        <figure class="chal-shot">
          <img src="https://dev-website.ithena.app/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/menu-spot-a-shopfloor.webp" alt="A laptop on the shop floor showing the iSERV equipment overview, with packaging machinery running behind it." width="720" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
