              <div class="skus">
                <div><span></span><span class="q"></span><span></span><span></span><span class="x"></span></div>
                <div><span class="x"></span><span></span><span></span><span class="q"></span><span></span></div>
                <div><span></span><span></span><span class="x"></span><span></span><span></span></div>
                <div><span class="q"></span><span class="x"></span><span></span><span></span><span class="x"></span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="cost">
            <div>
              <h3>Aftermarket revenue you never see.</h3>
              <p>Fragmented service processes and limited parts visibility result in missed revenue opportunities. Every order placed with someone else was one you were closest to filling.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="dia" aria-hidden="true">
